      "text": " \t\t4小節：ポケモンフレーズ\t\t緊張",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787089956,
      "updated": 1787097784
    },
    {
      "id": "6a84efbc000000000068880e",
      "text": " \t\t\tモチーフの繰り返しで緊張感を高めていく",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787097021,
      "updated": 1787097021
    },
    {
      "id": "6a84ee7a0000000000688804",
      "text": "  \t\t半小節：ポケモン小モチーフ\t\t\t緊張",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787096699,
      "updated": 1787098264
    },
    {
      "id": "6a84ee7a0000000000688805",
      "text": "  \t\t半小節：ポケモン小モチーフ再現\t\t緊張",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787096699,
      "updated": 1787098264
    },
    {
      "id": "6a84ee7a0000000000688806",
      "text": "  \t\t半小節：ポケモン小モチーフ再現\t\t緊張",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787096699,
      "updated": 1787098264
    },
    {
      "id": "6a84ee7a0000000000688807",
      "text": "  \t\t半小節：ポケモン小モチーフ再現\t\t緊張",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787096699,
      "updated": 1787098265
    },
    {
      "id": "6a84ee7a0000000000688808",
      "text": "  \t\t半小節：ポケモン小モチーフ再現\t\t緊張",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787096699,
      "updated": 1787098265
    },
    {
      "id": "6a84ee7a0000000000688809",
      "text": "  \t\t半小節：ポケモン小モチーフ再現\t\t緊張",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787096699,
      "updated": 1787098266
    },
    {
      "id": "6a84ee7a000000000068880a",
      "text": "  \t\t半小節：ポケモン小モチーフ再現\t\t緊張",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787096699,
      "updated": 1787098266
    },
    {
      "id": "6a84ee7a000000000068880b",
      "text": "  \t\t半小節：ポケモン小モチーフ再現\t\t緊張",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787096699,
      "updated": 1787098267
    },
    {
      "id": "6a84efc2000000000068880f",
      "text": " ループ頭へ",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787097028,
      "updated": 1787097046
    },
    {
      "id": "6a84ee7a000000000068880c",
